# Stable spec ID: cointreau-margarita. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(orange liqueur @ !Cointreau) 1 oz
(tequila; blanco) 2 oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 1 oz
(salt) for rim

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<coat, glass rim with salt>
<shake, liquid ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, over ice in (rocks glass)>
<garnish, with lime zest>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
For this producer-version reference OSF deliberately fixes Cointreau. Other orange liqueurs belong to a separately authored version; this does not claim all Margaritas need Cointreau.

